        <mxCell id="pl-c1-logic" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8EAF6;strokeColor=#3F51B5;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1A237E;align=left;spacingLeft=15;" value="&lt;b&gt;Validation Container Logic:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Receives TASK_TOKEN environment variable from Step Functions.&lt;br&gt;2. Validates CSV schemas and exact column pandas dtypes.&lt;br&gt;3. Moves valid files to ready folders: orders/, order_items/, products/.&lt;br&gt;4. Invokes stepfunctions.send_task_success() with payload:&lt;br&gt;   {&quot;orders&quot;: 0|1, &quot;order_items&quot;: 0|1, &quot;products&quot;: 0|1}." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="160" width="460" x="406" y="223" as="geometry" />
